WIRE.md §6.1: a glob's base must be readable as a directory; here it is a plain file, so the
walk itself fails and is reported at the load.dir, not silently as zero matches.
-- pattern --
data.json/*.json
-- data.json --
{}
-- findings.txt --
error[E7004]  pattern:1:1
  cannot read data.json/: not a directory

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
